---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Viger Cloud"
  description="Business software that reveals the truth behind your numbers. Point of sale, inventory, finance and more — one login across every app."
>
  <section class="hero container">
    <div class="brand-plate">
      <img src="/assets/viger-cloud-wordmark.png" alt="Viger Cloud" />
    </div>
    <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top: 1.5rem">Business software suite</p>
    <h1>See the truth in your numbers</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Viger Cloud gives independent businesses calm, honest tools — from point of sale to
      finance. One login. Every app. Evidence you can act on.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="/products/arcarna" class="btn btn-primary">Explore arcarna</a>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-secondary">Request a demo</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why Viger Cloud</p>
      <h2>Built for operators who want evidence, not hype</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        Most business software impresses in a demo and disappoints on a Tuesday afternoon. We
        build instruments you can trust when the numbers don't add up.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="feature-icon">1</div>
        <h3>One login, every app</h3>
        <p class="muted">
          Sign in once at viger.cloud. Your session works across arcarna, Vault, Sanctum and
          every tool in the suite.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="feature-icon">2</div>
        <h3>Truths, not dashboards</h3>
        <p class="muted">
          arcarna converts your sales, stock and costs into evidence with next moves — not
          charts that look good and explain nothing.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="feature-icon">3</div>
        <h3>Calm by design</h3>
        <p class="muted">
          Plain language, plain visuals, British English. No revolutionary AI. No exclamation
          marks. Just the number and what to do about it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Products</p>
      <h2>The Viger Cloud suite</h2>
      <p class="lead">New tools appear as they go live. arcarna is available today.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <a href="/products/arcarna" class="card product-card" style="--card-accent: #4ba9fb">
        <span class="app-tag">Live</span>
        <h3>arcarna</h3>
        <p class="muted">Point of sale, inventory, customers and the truths behind your numbers.</p>
      </a>
      <div class="card product-card" style="--card-accent: #8a8f98">
        <span class="app-tag app-tag-muted">Coming soon</span>
        <h3>Vault</h3>
        <p class="muted">Backup storage — databases and exports, safe and recoverable.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card product-card" style="--card-accent: #7c3aed">
        <span class="app-tag app-tag-muted">Coming soon</span>
        <h3>Sanctum</h3>
        <p class="muted">File storage — shared documents and uploads for your business.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem; text-align: center">
      <a href="/products">View all products →</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ready to reveal your truth?</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-inline: auto; margin-bottom: 1.5rem">
        Start with arcarna — or talk to us about the right plan for your business.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="https://arcarna.viger.cloud/" class="btn btn-primary">Open arcarna</a>
        <a href="/pricing" class="btn btn-secondary">View pricing</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .product-card {
    display: block;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    position: relative;
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }

  .product-card::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 0 auto 0;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--card-accent);
    border-radius: 0.75rem 0.75rem 0 0;
  }

  .product-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--card-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
